``` IX-03 | Hot Bucket Roll Storm
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry IX-03. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH.
    Query: Main query
    If this returns nothing, run probes/IX-03-probe.spl to confirm the data it
    reads exists here.
```
index=_internal sourcetype=splunkd component=HotBucketRoller
    "finished moving hot to warm" earliest=-24h
| rex field=_raw "\bidx=(?<idx>\S+)"
| rex field=_raw "\bcaller=(?<caller>\S+)"
| rex field=_raw "\bsize=(?<size_bytes>\d+)"
| eval size_mb=round(size_bytes / 1024 / 1024, 1)
| stats count as rolls
        median(size_mb) as median_mb
        perc10(size_mb) as p10_mb
        dc(host) as peers
        by idx caller
| eval rolls_per_peer_hr=round(rolls / peers / 24, 1)
| sort - rolls
